Subject: [PATCH 17/22] TopK wave32 support

- Add wave32 bitonic sort and merge paths
- Use runtime wave size for host launch math
- Keep values and indices paired in shuffles
- Cover sort, merge, dtype, and direction cases

Tools used:
- GPT: 5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
